    <div class="reveal"><h2>Small businesses need clarity, not another complicated screen.</h2><p>That idea shaped MarketMate. A staff member signs in, manages the catalog and account records, then records a sale. Stock falls by the quantity sold and the transaction stays in history. The information remains connected instead of being scattered across separate lists.</p></div>
